  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  </span>has released the Exam Date for the Combined Central Armed Police Force CAPF Examination 2026. This recruitment was released for 349 posts. Applications for the UPSC CAPF AC Recruitment 2026 were accepted from 20 February 2026, to 12 March 2026. The written examination is going to be conducted on 19 July 2026. Candidates who had applied this form can download their UPSC CAPF AC Exam Date 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Union Public Service Commission (UPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSC CAPF AC Exam Date 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSC Advt No. : 08/2026-CAPF</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>20 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>12 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>12 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date :<strong> 19 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC :<strong> Rs. 200/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST :<strong> 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Female :&nbsp;<b>0/-&nbsp;</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSC CAPF Assistant Commandant Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 August 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>20 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>25 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPSC CAPF Assistant Commandant Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">